# The design audit's working measurements.
#
# `scratch/design/` holds the JSON the tape measure writes — one file per
# screen per width, plus the string map the Figma migration reads. It is
# regenerated by one command (see the end of docs/DESIGN_AUDIT.md) and it
# is large, so the repository keeps the report and the plates rather than
# the intermediate numbers.
